<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones have struck Kurdish opposition camps and bases in Iraq, while Iranian-backed militias accuse the US of violating Iraqi airspace and Baghdad probes suspected Israeli strikes. Iraq has responded by closing Iran border crossings and strengthening its frontier with Saudi Arabia amid protests over the closures. Kurdish groups and Iranian forces continue to exchange attacks, heightening regional tensions. The conflict caused 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFAxMnNyV2tFTHZyOHo2UzAxOXd2WGY2cmRlZUVwZ1p4VndhT3o3RWZ1M21NYU1rS3pkenFWVl93WGc2NUdIeXVhRmpURENka21B?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة يافا الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPcC1jVC1LbG9taW5rcE4wdnp2RDk4QWNMLUR2NVh0QzBTWVBHZFcwcndwbm91Q1FFUER4X0dHQTFsZ3k0QUg5a2kyNExmbXVkTElteTlGb3p2bERkSEJCRjBLZkxISThmaHdTbkItMkZLbndRZERGY0VNbTVKZWdHb1l3LVlMYVpYSWhLdkhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNM1JwTndFOEdoa0pGMjJTSWxwbXE0Q1VyblVsb3pUUHZCaFc0N3FnY2pjcmFTNWE5MGVGdy1mZmxYNnVlT3R0VGNaYzZxWno4cDNGZkFtQU1yM3JHVDdNR01PZmtSUEgybnNFczEwTVVUY1podUxnVDYwQ2k2Z3JBVTN4V3E1dUw4?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNbmxTRHNIcngxVE9YMjZyclNNUDNqeEJvLUR0LUNQSUt6RlpXYlJfOGJoYWtEYzJtOTk3NnNBRXpJMEZsTDBKeUI4MG5HVDFGVFk1aGwwTG95UlBUVVlyQnI0MmVsekJCdGFHWXpVQl